Yes.

95
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:25,440
Osman was in the tent. Now, Osman
rules the city.

96
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:30,450
Mashallah.
Say Mashallah, Bayındır Bey.

97
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,340
